ucspi-ssl (0.13.07-7) trixie; urgency=low

  * Ship a DSMR-focused GNU info manual and HTML doc page derived from an
    org-mode source of truth (doc/ucspi-ssl.org): the UCSPI/TLS model, the one
    Debian install-paths patch, the fehQlibs linkage, how the qmail services
    use sslserver, the certificate convention, and the SSL_* child environment.
    Upstream per-command man pages continue to ship as-is.  Generators (emacs,
    texinfo, pandoc) are Build-Depends only.  Supersedes the old README.dsmr.

